PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "What do you want?\n"
    .string "Why are you here?$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "I give up!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "I'm not going to forget this!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "This old guy marched right up to\n"
    .string "our HIDEOUT.\p"
    .string "Then, he starts ranting about how\n"
    .string "TEAM ROCKET's abusing POKéMON.\p"
    .string "So, we're just talking it over as\n"
    .string "adults.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Please!\n"
    .string "No more!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "POKéMON are only good for making\n"
    .string "money. Why not use them?\p"
    .string "You stay out of our business!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "You're not saving anyone, kid!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Don't fight us ROCKETS!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "You're not getting away with this!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_MrFujiThankYouFollowMe::
    .string "MR. FUJI: Heh?\n"
    .string "You came to save me?\p"
    .string "Thank you. But, I came here of my\n"
    .string "own free will.\p"
    .string "I came to calm the spirit of\n"
    .string "CUBONE's mother.\p"
    .string "I think MAROWAK's spirit has\n"
    .string "finally left us.\p"
    .string "I must thank you for your kind\n"
    .string "concern.\p"
    .string "Follow me to my home, POKéMON\n"
    .string "HOUSE, at the foot of this tower.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JessieJamesStop::
    .string "Stop right there!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JessieJamesIntro::
    .string "Grampa here wanted to complain,\n"
    .string "so we're setting him straight.\p"
    .string "So render yourself invisible, or\n"
    .string "prepare to fight!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JessieJamesDefeat::
    .string "You will regret this!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JessieJamesBlastOff::
    .string "Looks like TEAM ROCKET's blasting\n"
    .string "off again!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JessieNoGhostsHere::
    .string "JESSIE: Ghosts? Please. There's\n"
    .string "nothing in this tower but us and\l"
    .string "that nosy brat.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_ColdBreath::
    .string "The lights died. Something cold and\n"
    .string "giggling swept through the room!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JamesLickedEar::
    .string "JAMES: Eeek! S-something just licked\n"
    .string "my ear!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JessieStopScreaming::
    .string "JESSIE: Stop screaming, JAMES!\n"
    .string "You're embarrassing us!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_MeowthBehindYou::
    .string "MEOWTH: D-d-don't look now… but\n"
    .string "dere's somethin' floatin' right\l"
    .string "behind ya!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_LaughterFades::
    .string "The ghostly laughter drifted up the\n"
    .string "stairs and faded away…$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_JessieNotScared::
    .string "JESSIE: Ahem! For the record, we\n"
    .string "were NOT scared!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_NVoices::
    .string "N: So many voices in this tower.\p"
    .string "POKéMON who lost their TRAINERS.\n"
    .string "TRAINERS who lost their POKéMON.\p"
    .string "The old man you saved listens to\n"
    .string "them too. That's why they love him.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_NLetsBattle::
    .string "N: Show me again. I want to know\n"
    .string "if your bond has changed.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_NDefeat::
    .string "It's grown stronger. And so\n"
    .string "has its voice…$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_NAfter::
    .string "N: People hurt POKéMON, and\n"
    .string "people save them.\p"
    .string "I don't know yet which one is\n"
    .string "the truth about people.$"
